 "reason": "Steam hose-station drop corroded at the elbow.",
 "scope": [
  "Isolate per the isolation list; drain, vent and purge 1\"-P300-HS-5013 between the isolations; confirm gas-free for hot work.",
  "Remove spool 1\"-P300-HS-5013-SP03 (5 items, 33'-1-3/16\" of pipe) — cut at the field welds and break the flanged joints at its ends as listed.",
  "Fabricate the replacement spool to ISO-1\"-P300-HS-5013 with the same items (parts list), welding to WS-01; 4 shop welds.",
  "Install the spool; make 2 field welds; new gaskets and studs at flanged ends, tightened per SW-WO-5.",
  "NDE per the NDE table; hydrostatic test at 420 psi for 30 minutes with the relief valves blinded (SW-TEST-1).",
  "Remove blinds, restore the line-up, hand back."
 ],
